# The generation and grading APIs. Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in, or
# point `armada.toml [env].canonical` at a shared .env on this machine and keep
# no copy here. Keys are read by name; no tool ever prints a value.
#
#   python tools/envload.py --check GEMINI_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY

GEMINI_API_KEY=
